  "description": "SQL provider implementations for OmniDataAccess (PostgreSQL, CockroachDB, MySQL, SQL Server, SQLite) plus the OmniDB ORM layer. Includes an async-first ADO.NET-style manager (ISqlDatabaseManager) with mapped queries, streaming, paging, entity CRUD, bulk operations, transactions with savepoints, and stored procedures — and a higher-level entity API with a fluent LINQ query builder, eager loading, soft delete, optimistic concurrency, schema generation, and migrations.",
